  ◈ SSHWAVE                                     6 hosts · 3 rules  ⚠ 1 problem  
────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
                                                                                
                                                                                
                                                                                
                                                                                
              ╭─ Keys ───────────────────────────────────────────╮              
              │  j/k ↑↓ g/G  move / top / bottom                 │              
              │  /           search (fuzzy)                      │              
              │  enter / e   edit ~/.ssh/config in $EDITOR       │              
              │  m           move host to group                  │              
              │  n / c       edit note / connect with ssh        │              
              │  space       fold / unfold a group               │              
              │  x           allow ssh -G for this load          │              
              │  esc         clear search / close                │              
              │  ? / q       this help / quit                    │              
              │                                                  │              
              │ A backup is saved before every edit.             │              
              ╰──────────────────────────────────────────────────╯              
                                                                                
                                                                                
                                                                                
                                                                                
